# ry_cg_half_dag — Ry(−arccos(⅓)/2) (ry_cg_half 의 dagger; HE2 T1 승인 module). CCRy(arccos⅓) 분해의 역회전 성분. Ry(α)=YPowGate(exponent=α/π) up-to-phase(C4). analytic golden.
```python id=bloq
import numpy as np
from qualtran.bloqs.basic_gates import YPowGate
bloq = YPowGate(exponent=float(-np.arccos(1.0/3.0) / (2.0*np.pi)))
```
```python id=golden
import numpy as np
a = -np.arccos(1.0/3.0) / 2.0
golden = np.array([[np.cos(a/2), -np.sin(a/2)], [np.sin(a/2), np.cos(a/2)]], dtype=complex)
```
